In summary, the proposed AA- CNN frame offers a dependable, interpretable, and effective result for early seizure vaticination using EEG signals. unborn work will concentrate on large- scale clinical confirmation and adaptive literacy for different patient biographies. The proposed AA-CNN achieves better accuracies of 92.35% for CHB-MIT dataset and 92.41% for Bonn University dataset which is better than state of art models. © 2026 IEEE.},
